  "description": "The party's just getting started. So grab your helmet, grab your Aeras and grab another round on a fast, efficient, fun alloy frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, Shimano components, and Tektro disc brakes. Whether you're riding for fitness, transportation or fun, the Aeras is your bike for a good time.\nHaro Ventus Sport Hybrid frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, mechanically-shaped alloy tubing, and chainstay disc brake mount\nHaro Ventus steel fork with disc mounts\nShimano TY301 crankset, 48/38/28t and sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Altus rear derailleur\nShimano Tourney 7-spd EZ Fire shifters\nShimano Dual Pull front derailleurs\nPivit alloy disc hubs w/ Alex DC-26 700c alloy double wall rims\nPivit alloy 9 degree sweep flattop barand forged stem\nTektro Aires mechanical disc brakes\nVP nylon body w/ steel cages",
